  "front": "photo - the front photograph at ~2.99 px/mm across the 442 mm body: badge strip 0-21, RCB slots at y 22.0 and 60.1 (1.5 in slot height as MX10004), service band to y 117, line-card banks at y 117.0 + i*48.4 and y 317.6 + i*48.4 with the thin divider between them; positions approximate to ~2 mm",
